# A non-atomic batch dead-letters an entry and still writes it.
MODULE: BatchAccountingDeadLetterStillWritten
TARGET: BatchAccounting
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a versioning dead-letter keeps the diverted entry
PERTURBS: RunVersioning

--- FIND
       ELSE /\ dlq' = dlq + 1 /\ dropped' = dropped + 1 /\ refusedBy' = "V"
            /\ NextEntry(kept)
--- REPLACE
       ELSE /\ dlq' = dlq + 1 /\ dropped' = dropped + 1 /\ refusedBy' = "V"
            /\ NextEntry(Append(kept, val))
--- END
